# Alternative: truly 10/10/5 mol initial gas (partial pressures 0.4/0.4/0.2 atm, V chosen so n_total~25 mol)
SOLUTION 1
    temp      150
    pH        7
    pe        4
    -water    1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -volume 868
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g) 0.4
    CO2(g) 0.4
    NH3(g) 0.2
END
